tools.description:
Zoom to a rectangular document/canvas region and capture it as PNG. This moves the visible viewport. Oversized PNGs are downsampled without cropping, preserving the complete requested region.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__easyeda_pro__easyeda_canvas_capture_region(args: {
  // Second vertical edge; either edge order is accepted.
  bottom: number;
  // First horizontal edge in document/canvas coordinates.
  left: number;
  // Second horizontal edge; either edge order is accepted.
  right: number;
  tabId?: string;
  // First vertical edge in document/canvas coordinates.
  top: number;
}): Promise<CallToolResult<{ byte_length?: number; captured: boolean; downsampled?: boolean; error?: string; file_name?: string; image_base64?: string; image_dimensions?: { height: number; width: number; }; mime_type?: string; not_available?: boolean; original_image_dimensions?: { height: number; width: number; }; payload_budget_bytes?: number; }>>; };
```

Look up generic engineering reference guidance: IPC-2221 trace-width/current-capacity, clearance bands, protocol routing data (USB/RS-485/I2C/SPI/UART/Ethernet), decoupling recipes and bulk capacitance sizing, and a static DFM checklist. Every result cites a source and caveat: these are estimates, not certified values.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__easyeda_pro__easyeda_design_rules_lookup(args: {
  // Optional category filter for decoupling or dfm-checklist.
  category?: "digital-logic" | "mcu" | "analog" | "rf" | "crystal-oscillator" | "power-regulator" | "clearance" | "drilling" | "copper" | "solder-mask" | "silkscreen" | "panelization" | "assembly";
  // Required for trace-width and max-current. Copper weight in oz/ft².
  copperWeightOz?: number;
  // Required when topic is trace-width. Load current in amperes.
  currentA?: number;
  // Optional DFM checklist item id.
  id?: string;
  // Required for trace-width and max-current. Conductor layer location.
  layer?: "external" | "internal";
  // Required when topic is bulk-capacitance. Load current in amperes.
  loadA?: number;
  // Required when topic is clearance. Clearance location.
  location?: "external" | "internal";
  // Optional absolute minimum bulk capacitance in µF.
  minBulkCapacitanceUf?: number;
  // Optional minimum bulk capacitance per ampere in µF/A.
  minBulkCapacitanceUfPerA?: number;
  // Optional protocol filter when topic is protocol-routing.
  protocol?: "usb2" | "usb3" | "rs485" | "i2c" | "spi" | "uart" | "ethernet-10-100" | "ethernet-1000";
  // Required for trace-width and max-current. Allowed temperature rise in °C.
  temperatureRiseC?: number;
  // Reference topic to look up.
  topic: "trace-width" | "max-current" | "clearance" | "protocol-routing" | "decoupling" | "bulk-capacitance" | "dfm-checklist";
  // Required when topic is max-current. Trace width in mils.
  traceWidthMils?: number;
  // Required when topic is clearance. Working voltage in volts.
  voltageV?: number;
